[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0270","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0270.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0283","title":"SGI IRIX Performance Copilot 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"IRIX Performance Copilot（性能监控工具）在默认安装配置中，其 pmcd 守护进程未设置有效的访问控制机制，导致远程攻击者可通过网络直接访问该服务，获取目标系统的敏感性能数据与系统信息。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用，影响 SGI IRIX 操作系统的多个版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0283"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:23Z","remediation":"限制 pmcd 守护进程的网络访问，在防火墙上仅允许受信主机访问 TCP 4321 端口；如无需 Performance Copilot 功能则停止并禁用 pmcd 服务；升级 SGI 官方发布的安全补丁；对于仍运行 IRIX 的系统建议迁移至受支持的操作系统平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0056.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1106","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0283.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0283","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0283.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0283.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/irix_copilot.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r4wv-238c-4wf9/GHSA-r4wv-238c-4wf9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4f831d0f-2945-4421-89cd-6f0917b597ee.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001284.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0270.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0255","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0255.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0287","title":"CNC Technology BizDB 1.0 bizdb-search.cgi 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"CNC Technology BizDB 1.0 的 bizdb-search.cgi 脚本存在远程命令执行漏洞。攻击者可在未经验证的情况下，通过向 dbname 参数注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）执行任意系统命令，从而完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞危害等级严重，CVSS 评分 10.0，影响 BizDB 1.0 版本，无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0287"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:24Z","remediation":"立即停用 bizdb-search.cgi 脚本或限制其访问来源 IP；对 dbname 参数进行严格输入过滤，禁止 shell 元字符（; | & ` $ 等）传入；如业务需要，建议迁移至受支持的现代数据库管理应用，不再使用已停止维护的 BizDB 1.0。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0058.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1104","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19844","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0287.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0287","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0287.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0287.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/bizdb1_search.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0287.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769