b/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0282.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3j9x-r422-3rxr/GHSA-3j9x-r422-3rxr.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/W/webplus.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0282.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001283.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0252.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0235","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0235.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0262","title":"AVM KEN! ISDN Proxy 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"AVM KEN! ISDN Proxy Server 1.3.10 及 1.4.30 版本存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的畸形请求报文，触发服务处理异常导致崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需认证即可触发，攻击门槛低，受影响设备在公共网络下攻击面较大。厂商暂未发布官方补丁，建议限制网络访问权限缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0262"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:20Z","remediation":"升级 AVM KEN! 至 1.4.31 或更高版本。如厂商已停止支持该产品，建议停止使用 AVM KEN! ISDN Proxy 并迁移至现代替代方案；临时缓解措施可在防火墙或边界设备上限制对 ISDN Proxy 服务的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0073.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1103","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=383085010.956159226625.JavaMail.root%40web305-mc.mail.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19843","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0262.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0262","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0262.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0262.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vx5q-wxf4-cq9p/GHSA-vx5q-wxf4-cq9p.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/ken_segfault.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0262.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4e3cd672-dbc1-43c9-93f1-8d06acec952e.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0235.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0233","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0233.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0259","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 加密密钥泄露漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 中 Cryptography\\Offload 注册表项的默认权限设置过于宽松，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞读取并获取其他用户的加密密钥，导致敏感信息泄露和加密数据被破解。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及 Terminal Server 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需额外认证即可利用。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS00-024 中发布补丁修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0259"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:20Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-024 提供的注册表权限修复工具（下载链接见 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=AB792154-6BBD-4D27-9C87-8C7689BD908F），该工具将 `HKLM\\System\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Cryptography\\Offload` 注册表项权限重置为仅允许管理员修改。如无法安装工具，可手动将该注册表项的权限设置为仅 Administrators 组完全控制，移除 Users 组的写入权限。终端服务器场景下应同时限制非信任用户的交互式登录权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1105","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-024","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0259.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0259","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0259.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0259.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pqj9-rmm9-j2pp/GHSA-pqj9-rmm9-j2pp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0259.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001281.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--354cac40-c4cf-4d5c-92e5-9da3e0e14b4b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0233.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0232","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0232.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0258","title":"Let me analyze this task. I need to generate a Chinese title for CVE-2000-0258 in the format \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型\" (Vendor Product Vulnerability Type). From the known information: - Vulnerability: CVE-2000-0258 - Product: Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 - Type: Denial of Service (拒绝服务) - The title should follow the pattern: \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型\" So: Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 拒绝服务漏洞 The sample given is: Microsoft Windows TCP/IP 远程代码执行漏洞 So following that pattern: Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 URL 拒绝服务漏洞 Wait, the original title from AVD already says \"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 URL 拒绝服务漏洞\". Let me think about whether I should simplify it or keep it. The format asks for: \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型\". So \"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 拒绝服务漏洞\" would work, but the original already has \"URL\" in the title to be more specific. Since CVSS score is 7.5 (HIGH) and it's a DoS, keeping it specific is good. Actually, looking at the sample more carefully: \"Microsoft Windows TCP/IP 远程代码执行漏洞\" - this is \"Vendor Product VulnerabilityType Vulnerability\". So the format is essentially \"Vendor Product VulnerabilityType\". For this: Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 拒绝服务漏洞 Or with the specific mechanism being URL-based: Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 URL 拒绝服务漏洞 I think the more specific one is better since it includes the attack vector (URL with escaped characters). Let me go with: Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 URL 拒绝服务漏洞 This is 20-100 characters, Chinese, follows the format.","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 及 5.0 版本存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20），远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送大量包含大量转义字符（百分号编码）的特制 URL 请求，导致 IIS 服务消耗过多系统资源而崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响 Windows NT/2000 平台上的 IIS Web 服务器。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0258"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:20Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-023 对应补丁，或升级至 IIS 6.0 及以上版本。如无法升级，可在 IIS 管理器中限制 URL 请求长度和转义字符数量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1101","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-023","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0258.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0258","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0258.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0258.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f3v5-8j87-jjrf/GHSA-f3v5-8j87-jjrf.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0258.yaml","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0258.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--58dfca10-7246-48e3-868f-5aefbf07596c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0232.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0234","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0234.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0261","title":"AVM KEN! Web服务器目录遍历漏洞","description":"AVM KEN! Web服务器存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者通过在URL中插入../序列，可绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击无需身份认证，利用难度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0261"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"2000-04-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-04-12T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级AVM KEN! Web服务器到已修复该漏洞的版本，或限制对服务器的网络访问权限，部署Web应用防火墙拦截目录遍历攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T11:26:23Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0073.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1282","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1103"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0234.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0234.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0234.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0777","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0777.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0253","title":"Dansie Shopping Cart 隐藏表单域敏感信息修改漏洞","description":"Dansie 购物车应用 cart.pl 中存在安全设计缺陷，远程攻击者可通过修改网页中隐藏表单字段（hidden form fields）的值来篡改敏感购买信息（如商品价格、数量等），从而实现以低于原价的价格完成订单。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击者只需向目标服务器发送包含恶意修改的隐藏表单字段值的 HTTP 请求即可触发。由于 danish cart.pl 未对隐藏表单字段进行服务端校验，导致任意未授权用户均可绕过支付逻辑。CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重，影响运行 Dansie shopping cart 的 Web 服务器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0253"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:19Z","remediation":"该漏洞源于 cart.pl 将商品价格、数量等敏感交易数据存放在 HTML 隐藏表单域中，攻击者可直接修改提交任意值。根本修复方案：废弃该 CGI 程序，改用服务端会话机制存储订单信息，所有价格、折扣等关键数据仅在服务端维护，不接受客户端提交。如仍在使用旧版 Perl CGI 购物车，须对所有隐藏表单提交的参数做服务端校验，或迁移至支持服务端会话的现代购物车系统（如 WooCommerce、Magento 等）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1115","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4621","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0253.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0253","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0253.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0253.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fv9x-crqp-rpqh/GHSA-fv9x-crqp-rpqh.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/dansie_cart.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_500_600.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-472.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0777.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0777.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0777.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0228","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0228.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0252","title":"Dansie Shopping Cart 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Dansie Shopping Cart 的 cart.pl 文件存在命令注入漏洞。攻击者可通过向表单变量中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等），使服务器执行任意系统命令，进而完全控制目标主机。该漏洞影响 Dansie Shopping Cart 的早期版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害严重。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0252"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:19Z","remediation":"将 Dansie Shopping Cart 升级至官方修复版本或替换为仍受支持的购物车系统。若无法立即升级，需修改 cart.pl 源码，在处理表单变量前使用 Perl 正则过滤 shell 元字符（如 ; & | ` $ ( ) { } < >），并对所有用户输入执行 `use CGI qw/:standard/; param() 配合 taint 模式` 确保数据安全。同时将 Web 服务器中 cart.pl 的执行用户降权为最低权限用户，在 Apache 中通过 `suEXEC` 或 `mod_suexec` 限制执行权限，并禁用不需要的 CGI 目录执行权限。如果条件允许，建议迁移至现代安全框架（如 Ruby on Rails 或 Django）并启用 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）拦截利用 shell 注入的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0051.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1115","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4975","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0252.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0252","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0252.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0252.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-37xg-wggh-6f34/GHSA-37xg-wggh-6f34.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/dansie_cart.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0252.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001278.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--503806f2-3f63-4ffe-bbc3-db8ba669d683.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0228.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0284","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0284.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0294","title":"FreeBSD healthd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统中的 healthd 守护进程存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该进程发送特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖内存中的关键数据，成功利用此漏洞可获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 系统，攻击者需要拥有本地访问权限才能利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0294"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:25Z","remediation":"立即升级 FreeBSD 至包含 FreeBSD-SA-00:10 安全公告补丁的版本（3.4-RELEASE 之后或 4.0-STABLE 之后），或应用 healthd 补丁修复缓冲区边界检查缺陷。如无法升级，可移除 healthd setuid 位并限制本地用户登录以降低提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/606","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1107","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=2162","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0294.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0294","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0294.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0294.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mfrr-gqjj-xm4x/GHSA-mfrr-gqjj-xm4x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0294.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dfd14b52-ae78-46e8-8a1a-aa384f088125.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/1e58254e5bdaf937b4bd41c6a50d0d633b